<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεννός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
			Aeol.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> almost always of sheep, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεννῇς ὀΐεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.424
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of woollen cloths, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεννῇσι καλυψαμένη ὀθόνῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.141
				</span></i>
			; later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μόσχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					574
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chaerem.
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.384.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόναι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.259
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.46
			</span></i> (Antip. Thess.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.795
				</span></i>
			.</div>
